## 3. Why This Workflow Is Superior

1. **Massive Token & Cost Savings:** Generating full 7-asset bundles across multiple tier lenses requires thousands of tokens. Discovering a scope misalignment *after* generation is costly. Validating a 2-page brief first costs pennies.
2. **Pedagogical Control:** LLMs excel at synthesis, but human experts excel at **contextual judgment**. The dialogue ensures human L&D directors retain creative control over tone, company culture fit, and story selection.
3. **True Customization for B2B Clients:** You can now tell enterprise clients: *"We don't give you off-the-shelf training. Our system compiles our global knowledge base into a custom-engineered proposal brief that we review and tailor specifically to your company's operational reality before producing a single workshop tool."*

